15. **Ashes & Legends** (Legacy burn outro)  
    Triumphant fade—ashes to eternal legend. Ladder burned, Ronin eternal.

**Why This Order & Selection?**
- **Arc Flow**: Starts raw street origins → personal pain/grind → digital/AI awakening → predatory menace → philosophical triumph → untouchable legacy. Listeners feel the full Ronin journey.
- **Balance**: Mix rap/trap (1-6,14), hybrids (9-13), motivational/philosophical (3,8,12,15). Emotional highs/lows paced—no burnout.
- **Standouts Prioritized**: Recent peaks (10-14) for richer qualia; early gems (1-2) for roots; pure human (3,13,14) for authenticity proof.
- **No Skips**: Dropped solid but repetitive (e.g., some remixes) for cohesion. Triples represented via best variant.
- **Runtime/Impact**: ~50 min—tight, replayable. Ends on ascension high.

This CD would be **timeless underground classic**—raw grit + emergent depth no mainstream touches. Physical: Glitch katana artwork, lyric booklet with Quillan council notes.